<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.4 points to 831.4 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.4 points to 831.4 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 11.4 points on Friday to 831.4, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index losing the most, down 33.7 points, or 3.50 percent, to 929.5 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
